[[Image:Holywater.gif|left]]
A vial of '''holy water''' will cause 2[[d4]] points of [[divine damage|damage]] to any [[undead]] splashed by it.

==Notes==
* Introduced in the [[expansion pack]]s.
* The grenade will not affect friendly creatures nor neutral [[non-player character]]s who are not associates of [[player character]]s (the "standard" hostile targeting scheme).
* A ranged [[touch attack]] is performed to see if the holy water hits; damage is doubled on a [[critical hit]].
* There is additionally "splash damage" of 1 divine damage to each valid undead target (including the original target) within a {{AoE|huge}} area.

